WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Camshaft timing pulley
What it does: Receives belt motion and establishes the camshaft relationship to the crankshaft.

2
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Camshaft timing pulley
How it works: The central connection transmits torque to the camshaft.

3
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Camshaft timing pulley
How it moves: Rotates with the camshaft at half crankshaft speed.
